# Revisions git blame should skip: whole-tree reformats that changed layout and
# nothing else. Without this, a formatting sweep sits across the blame of every
# line it touched and hides the commit that actually wrote the code.
#
# Enable locally:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub's blame view honours this file automatically, with no configuration.

